{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127760/extras/8a3c6124653ff7b35a77f88f87b0fd51.avif?t=1764950581\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a brave warrior who has fought many battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife is an elf, beautiful and unattainable, now serving the king.<br><br>The days that once belonged to you now belong to the throne. She spends more time with him than with you, and her eyes are increasingly fixed on where the fate of the kingdom is decided. You must make a choice: accept her new role and become a cuckold, or risk everything to win back her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e What awaits you in the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Atmospheric music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A sensual storyline where decisions have consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Multiple storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Picturesque CG scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision can cost a life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every touch is a test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept or fight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk everything or lose everything?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it's up to you whether love remains...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or burns forever in the fire of war.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Returning Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127760/1b90026d007b1c924c76a3a713cebae6c674c07a.jpg"},{"name":"This is no time to run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127760/7a514a68f8a3ca800118f0147edd130fd0cc8095.jpg"},{"name":"Evil is out there somewhere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/